flowchart TD
  A[Phase needs content] --> B[Agent sends Intake Request]
  B --> C{Desi provides source?}
  C -- export / CV / notes / answers --> D[Agent extracts candidates]
  C -- skips optional item --> H[Element hidden, not filled]
  D --> E[Confirmation table: value + source + wording]
  E --> F{Desi confirms row?}
  F -- edit --> E
  F -- remove --> H
  F -- ok --> G[Write to content/* with source + verified:true]
  G --> I[Build content gate]
  H --> I
  I --> J{Unverified item or TODO in production?}
  J -- yes --> K[Build fails]
  J -- no --> L[Proceed]
